        There is a hard limit for file upload sizes of 5 MB at this time.
        If you receive a "413 Payload Too Large" error while uploading a file via POST,
        the file you are attempting to upload is too large. There is no limit on the
        amount of threatFeeds files you can upload, so we recommend splitting apart
        your STIX file into smaller parts and uploading each as its own threat feed so
        that each file is below the 5MB limit.
